                    Drafted by Armitage and Buffum, cleared by Fessenden, and approved by Kohler who
                    signed for Dillon.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d195-f2" n="2" xml:id="d195-f2-content">
                <p>W. Randolph Burgess, Permanent Representative to the North Atlantic Treaty
                    Organization and European Regional Organizations at Paris.</p>
            </note>
